<profile>
    <name>Profile</name>
    <capability>
        <name>Principal Software Engineer / Software Architect</name>
        <item>
            Principal Software Engineer and Software Architect with more than 20 years
            of experience in embedded and systems software, with a focus on C/C++
            and Linux-based systems. Extensive experience in the architecture and
            development of complex embedded systems as well as technical responsibility
            for software platforms and key system-level decisions.
        </item>
        <item>
            Experience in technical leadership and consulting for software development
            teams, as well as in building build, integration, and development
            infrastructure without disciplinary personnel responsibility.
        </item>
    </capability>
</profile>
